# Never consume host installation or build output, even under allowed paths.
**/.git
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dev-dist
packages/cli/web
**/coverage
**/.vite
**/.wrangler
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.npmrc
**/.pnpmfile.cjs
**/.DS_Store
**/test-results
**/playwright-report
